v 3
d cge -- Computable general equilibrium (CGE) modelling in Stata
d
d Builds, calibrates and solves static and recursive dynamic, single-country CGE models
d from a social accounting matrix, using Stata and Mata: CES or
d Cobb-Douglas value added, CET exports, Armington imports,
d households, government, savings-investment and the rest of the
d world, with selectable closures and built-in validation checks; SAM tools
d for reading SAMs of any size, mapping templates, aggregation and RAS or
d cross-entropy balancing; SAM multipliers; a library of published elasticities, with sources.
d
d Requires: Stata 13 or later
d Author: Mustapha Wasseja
d
d Distribution-Date: 20261020
d
